      "source": "To use with <code>@ExtendWith</code>, inject the <a href=\"CapturedOutput.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.test.system\"><code>CapturedOutput</code></a> as an\nargument to your test class constructor, test method, or lifecycle methods:",
      "translation": "要与 `<code>@ExtendWith</code>` 配合使用，请将 <a href=\"CapturedOutput.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.test.system\"><code>CapturedOutput</code></a> 注入到您的测试类构造函数、测试方法或生命周期方法的参数中：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "To reliably capture output from Log4j2, set the <code>follow</code> attribute of the\nconsole appender to <code>true</code>:",
